  "description": "Protect the interior of your Hyundai Kona from the elements with the 2018-2023 Hyundai Kona Floor Mats. OEDRO recommends warming the mat in the sun to flatten it prior to installation. Once installed, each mat will mold to your car's floor to protect it from wet or dry messes.\nFeatures\nDurability. One of the best things about OEDRO floor mats is that they are developed with strong rubber. This gives them longevity in comparison to other styles of mats. The floor mats are quite flexible. The heavy-duty material is also capable of withstanding constant rubbing and contacting of shoes.\nExcellent Visual Appearance. By adding an all-weather floor liner to your car’s interior, you will add color and class to your car. The mat’s unique appearance will accentuate the interior look of your car tenfold.\nProtecting the Interior. OEDRO Floor mats offer vehicles perhaps the most comprehensive interior protection in comparison to any other car mat. Your car’s carpet will remain clean and dry at all times.\nCleaning these Mats is Quite Easy. The materials used for creating floor mats are extremely simple to wash and clean. You can easily wash and clean the spillage on top of it. You can also spray it using soap and water. Also, there won’t be any odor remaining once the mat dries out.\nIt Traps Dirt and Moisture. The waterproof surface of all-weather floor mats makes sure to trap any kind of spillage on top of it. The mats can also trap dust, sand, and other dry particles effectively.\n2-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2018 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 Hyundai Kona.\nNot Fit for Electric Models; NOT Fit vehicles with vinyl flooring.",
